{"data":{"content":"//// `gleam dev` serves the app at http://localhost:8000 (or `gleam dev 8001` for\n//// another port) and rebuilds it whenever a source file changes. `gleam dev\n//// publish` instead puts the files to deploy in public/. The work is in\n//// animator_dev_ffi.mjs.\n\nconst default_port = 8000\n\n@external(javascript, \"./animator_dev_ffi.mjs\", \"start\")\nfn start(default_port: Int) -> Nil\n\npub fn main() -> Nil {\n  start(default_port)\n}\n","line_count":14,"path":"dev\\animator_dev.gleam","sha256":"d15588d5e8eec3b4f023c1b1abd0775a232ba874dbdf5f0b637a645a366fbdd6"},"hash":"5b128c4365535d57abaa27763b30e3598c3313f7606728649a3bb9968f054513","kind":"doc.open","prev_hash":"5c506476bbdad6521557322544b8b2461b74997aadf9a4c6a763983bbcd2f82a","seq":18,"t":216449,"wall":"2026-11-15T21:22:10.156Z"}
